WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Have you hired a nurse for this matter?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Brother, I left tens of thousands in nursing fees

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
There are still 150,000 here. Let me pay it back to you first.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
I will definitely pay back the rest with the money I paid for the table later.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:18,980
Okay, there's no rush in this matter

6
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:22,580
What to do before eating

7
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:39,790
Wash your hands first before starting
